<title>GERMANY: German investment fund group appoints new head.</title>
<headline>German investment fund group appoints new head.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The association of German investment funds, BVI, said on Monday it had appointed Rolf Passow, head of Dresdner Bank's investment fund unit Deutsche Investment-Trust, to chair its management board.</p>
<p>Passow was voted in at the BVI's annual meeting in Berlin last week, the BVI said. He takes over from Manfred Mathes, who held the position for five years.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
